@* 
    CalendarCanvas - High Performance Canvas Calendar Component
    All rendering is done in JavaScript (Konva.js) for optimal performance.
    This Blazor component is a thin wrapper that:
    - Provides the container div
    - Sends data to JavaScript
    - Receives action callbacks from JavaScript
*@

<div id="@ContainerId" 
     class="calendar-canvas-container @CssClass" 
     style="width: 100%; height: @Height; position: relative;">
</div>


